&lt;h5&gt;②【自己株式等】&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 36px"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 611.99999999999999999999999999px"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
